{"id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-word-process.md","title":"Words and Finite Processes","display":"df-word-process — Words and Finite Processes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-word-process","aliases":["68-df-word-process"],"display":"df-word-process — Words and Finite Processes","depends_on":["[[68-df-natural-number]]","[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.29 / PDF 38","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-word-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-word-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-word-process — Words and Finite Processes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.29 / PDF 38"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是有限集合，其元素为字母标识。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\,^{\\frown}\">\\(\\,^{\\frown}\\)</span> 及单元素序列均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a> 的接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 是候选产生式集合，产生式以有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,Y)\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> 表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Word}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_{68}\">\\(\\epsilon_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Process}_{68}\\)</span> 在下式引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Omega^n,\\qquad \\epsilon_{68}:=().\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Omega^n,\\qquad \\epsilon_{68}:=().\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\,^\\frown V=U\\cup\\{(\\operatorname{lh}(U)+i,V(i)):i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(V)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\,^\\frown V=U\\cup\\{(\\operatorname{lh}(U)+i,V(i)):i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(V)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Omega|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2\\land|W|&lt;\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Omega|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2\\land|W|&lt;\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.29 / PDF p.38，alphabet 是有限符号序列，word 是其符号的有限序列，process 是有限产生式集。这里只将互异符号替换为自然数标识并以集合 Ω 给出可用符号；词序由有限序列自身保存。空字包含在 Ω^0，连接的两段定义域互不相交，因此并集是唯一有限序列。此处不把产生式当作无向等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 是有限集合，其元素为字母标识。$U,V$ 为有限序列，$\\operatorname{lh}$、$\\,^{\\frown}$ 及单元素序列均取 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]] 的接口。$W$ 是候选产生式集合，产生式以有序对 $(X,Y)$ 表示。$\\operatorname{Word}_{68}$、$\\epsilon_{68}$、$\\operatorname{Process}_{68}$ 在下式引入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\,^{\\frown}","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Omega^n,\\qquad \\epsilon_{68}:=().","display":true},{"tex":"U\\,^\\frown V=U\\cup\\{(\\operatorname{lh}(U)+i,V(i)):i<\\operatorname{lh}(V)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Omega|<\\aleph_0\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2\\land|W|<\\aleph_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1802,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2a2b4650e47dbfa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是集合，$\\mu$ 是候选二元函数图，$e$ 是候选单位元。$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 有限，$\\iota$ 为候选字母解释图，$M$ 为任意候选集合；$X,Y\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$，$z$ 为任意集合。词、长度、空词与连接见 [[68-df-word-process]] 及其有限序列依赖。"},{"id":"b4a73e7703406240","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$；词和过程见 [[68-df-word-process]]。$X,Y$ 是在下式中绑定的词。"},{"id":"833504bc40d11acb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。$\\operatorname{Word}_{68}$、连接 $^\\frown$ 与过程谓词见 [[68-df-word-process]]。$Z$ 是有限词序列，$Z(i)$ 是它的第 $i$ 项。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"词过程与结构：[[68-df-word-process]] → [[68-df-presented-word-semigroup]] → [[68-thm-word-process-semigroup-correspondence]]；[[68-df-first-order-syntax]] → [[68-df-first-order-semantics]] → [[68-df-theory-decidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["3368c1852f2a1aa0","c524671